      "text": "The line from S7 to S1 crosses the vertical line through P2 at P3. The line from S3 to S5 crosses the vertical line through P2 at P4. Draw a horizontal line through P3. Draw a horizontal line through P4. Turn the new lines round O by 45°, seven times.",
      "create": {
        "P3": {"point": {"meet": ["q04", "m2"]}},
        "P4": {"point": {"meet": ["q02", "m2"]}},
        "m3": {"line": {"through": "P3", "parallelTo": "h"}},
